<title>TURKEY: Turkish 182-day T-bill yield rises to 135.16 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkish 182-day T-bill yield rises to 135.16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 182-day T-bill auction of the Turkish treasury on Tuesday produced the following results.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    : May 14, 1997</p>
<p>	Amount			: 69.62 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
<p>	Minimum yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Maximum yield	     : 135.16</p>
<p>	Average yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Bid amount/cover	  : 181.54 trln</p>
<p>	Lowest accepted price   : 65,210 lira</p>
<p>Pct allocated at lowest price : -</p>
<p>	Payment date		: November 13, 1996</p>
<p>--Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
